The year is {{CURRENTYEAR}}. New Year's Eve.<br>
An age of decline and brutality.<br>
a brand new threat appears…<br>
Amidst economic collapse <br>
and political turmoil,<br>
THEY suddenly appeared:<br>
The Battle Cats.<br>
these Cats… are too cute.<br>
Devastation! Depravity!<br>
Disintegration! Delight!<br>
Deep-Fried Donuts! Ding-Dong Ditch!<br>

I tried every ominous word I knew to<br>
dissuade them, but onward they marched.<br>

Now that I think about it,<br>
"Kitty" kinda rhymes with "Spaghetti".<br>
Or maybe it doesn't really. Forget I said that.<br><br>
And you know, if remembering the feline heroes<br>
on Saturday morning TV gets you nostalgic,<br>
you might want to check<br>
your scalp for gray hairs.<br>



The other day,<br>
I tried writing a letter by hand,<br>
but my handwriting was <br>
absolute garbage, so I gave up.<br>

I've forgotten how bad my writing was.<br>
I probably shouldn't have started writing<br>
without even knowing who I'm writing to...<br>

<br>
When I was a kid,<br>
I used to say I would be a pro athlete<br>
with a straight face.<br>
Ah, I was so young and naive.<br><br>
But thinking about it,<br>
I still believe in my heart that I<br>
have the potential to become<br>
a filthy rich manga artist if I really tried.<br>

I mean,<br>
If you have money,<br>
You don't need love, right?<br>

Can money buy love?<br>

YES / NO<br>



Whatever the answer is…<br>
I want to tell you one thing.<br>

Honestly,<br>
I don't really care either way.<br>

I just want to say one thing:<br>
The Battle Cats<br>


aren't so bad when you get to know 'em!<br>
So... That's pretty much it for now.<br>


Bye!<br>
