And so,<br>
the world was completely overrun<br>
by the Battle Cats.<br>


A government of the Cats,<br>
by the Cats,<br>
for the Cats...<br>
The dawn of a new age!<br>




Or so I thought.<br>
Honestly, our day-to-day<br>
hasn't changed in the slightest.<br>



If anything's changed, it's that<br>
we just see a few more Cats<br>
loitering on the streets.<br>


So, yeah... That's about it, I guess.<br>




Actually, there is one thing!<br>

A Cat actually showed up<br>
for a job interview<br>
at my company the other day.<br>



I mean,<br>
we're desperately short-staffed,<br>
but a literal Cat wouldn't fit the job.<br>



But, you know...<br>



Having a Cat just hanging around<br>
your office or at your school...<br>



Is it just me,<br>
or would that actually<br>
be kinda awesome? <br>





Anyway...<br>


The Battle Cats!<br>

The Battle Cats!<br>



Three cheers for...<br>
The Battle Cats!!!<br>






